mk(1, 'denticity', 'The denticity of ethane-1,2-diamine (en) is', 'two', ['one', 'three', 'six'], '<p>en, H<sub>2</sub>N-CH<sub>2</sub>-CH<sub>2</sub>-NH<sub>2</sub>, has two N donor atoms, so it is bidentate. It forms a five-membered chelate ring with the metal.</p>');
