mk(1, 'coordination sphere', 'In K<sub>4</sub>[Fe(CN)<sub>6</sub>] the coordination sphere is', '[Fe(CN)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>4-</sup>', ['K<sub>4</sub>', 'Fe<sup>2+</sup> alone', 'CN<sup>-</sup> alone'], '<p>The coordination sphere is the metal plus its ligands, written inside square brackets: [Fe(CN)<sub>6</sub>]<sup>4-</sup>. The four K<sup>+</sup> are counter ions outside the sphere and ionise in water.</p>');
